<rss version="2.0"><channel><title>IndieHOT 独立游戏热点</title><link>https://staroltest.github.io/indie-game-hot/</link><description>IndieHOT 每天从一批独立游戏信源里收动态，按规则打分精选：引擎与工具、发行与宣发、开发日志、行业与融资、展会与活动、评测与复盘。只显示标题、一句自己写简介与原文链接，不转载全文。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 13:04:58 GMT</lastBuildDate><item><title>对话在日从业者：腾讯”怪猎“手游为何在日本畅销榜登顶?</title><link>http://www.chuapp.com/article/291753.html</link><description>腾讯天美与卡普空合作的《怪物猎人：旅人》上线半月稳居日本 iOS 畅销榜前五，触乐对话在日从业者聊它在日本的打法与玩家口味。</description><pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 09:05:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">9b5c909668025aa143f876d8643808ac41976ee0</guid><source url="http://www.chuapp.com/article/291753.html">触乐</source></item><item><title>自己掌控的 Unity 后端：用 C# 工具链对接 Supabase</title><link>https://dev.to/shipitunity/a-unity-backend-you-own-c-tooling-for-supabase-40ai</link><description>讲如何在 Unity 2022.3+ 项目里用身份验证、行级安全、云存档与实时同步，搭一套自己说了算的后端数据通路。</description><pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 06:44:58 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">e600f62733ef3dba820a839c98e9c851d7252b13</guid><source url="https://dev.to/shipitunity/a-unity-backend-you-own-c-tooling-for-supabase-40ai">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>这款类《杀戮尖塔》游戏由成千上万张堆叠插画搭建而成</title><link>https://80.lv/articles/this-slay-the-spire-style-game-is-built-from-thousands-of-stacked-illustrations</link><description>看看《Shroom and Gloom》的世界在引擎里是如何用成千上万张堆叠插画呈现出来的，给做卡牌肉鸽的开发者一点美术思路。</description><pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 12:39:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">5b5f24a124a2ae6771428a8c60ff17718277648a</guid><source url="https://80.lv/articles/this-slay-the-spire-style-game-is-built-from-thousands-of-stacked-illustrations">80 Level</source></item><item><title>6 行 JS 屏幕震动加顿帧技巧，立刻给游戏加上打击感</title><link>https://dev.to/goutam_lambu_0a07d682a4ee/add-instant-game-feel-with-this-6-line-js-screen-shake-hit-stop-trick-b8</link><description>不用物理引擎，只需在渲染循环里加几行画布平移代码，就能让 2D HTML5 小游戏拥有街机般的打击感。</description><pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 18:55:16 GMT</pubDate><guid is